title: Cameras - 50/50 Split View in Camera Menu Enable
raw_community_title: ⚡ [Lightning] Cameras - 50/50 Split View in Camera Menu Enable
category: Cameras and ADAS
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2023
trim: All
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
notes: '[Category: Cameras and ADAS] [Years: 2022-2023] [Original Title: Enable 50/50
  view in camera menu]

  Adds a button to Sync camera selection screen that shows a 50/50 view of the two
  side cameras. Standard on 2024+.'
steps:
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-01-01
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx *xxx xx--
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 1
      action: 1
      feature: 50/50 Views (V)
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-01-04
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx xxxx x*--
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature: 50/50 View at Speed (VS)
recipe_version: '1.1'
